# Raiden Chevreuse Xinyan Bennett. ~18s Rot. Raiden Overload with SubDPS Chevreuse and Xinyan nuking in Bennett's burst before Raiden takes the field. Xinyan's uninvested shield durabilty is suspect for ToM or EM builds, but it should linger enough for RES shred though Raiden's field time.

# Team
raiden char lvl=90/90 cons=0 talent=9,9,9;
raiden add weapon="catch" refine=5 lvl=90/90;
raiden add set="emblem" count=4;
raiden add stats hp=4780 atk=311 er=0.518 electro%=0.466 cr=0.311; #main
raiden add stats def%=0.124 def=39.36 hp=507.88 hp%=0.0992 atk=33.08 atk%=0.0992 er=0.2204 em=39.64 cr=0.331 cd=0.7944;

